# Who he left
tabrl:
| Person | What passes between them |
| Miriam | A Binding she believed in, and a man she did love (TL) |
| Eden | One year old when he left (TL). Carries his name. |
| Leah | Born the year he left (INFERENCE) |
| Zion | Conceived before he left, born after, with no memory of him (FR 0). Works in his category of labor without knowing it (MEN). |
| The other woman | Another Dominion, another life (FR 3) |
DECIDED: No expansion of Thomas's later life this pass (FR 3). The page below is for when you want one.
